{"read_id": "READ-20261113-713994", "session_id": "SESSION-20261113-0d7479", "created_at": "2026-11-13", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261113-f906e9", "type": "material"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Dawkins 1976 第2版の Ch.2・3・13 を narod.ru 全文HTMLで読んだ。全章は未読。"}
{"read_id": "READ-20261113-e553f3", "session_id": "SESSION-20261113-0d7479", "created_at": "2026-11-13", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261113-7a8f12", "type": "material"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "Odling-Smee et al. 2003 の §1–2 と著者ら BBS 2000 標題論文の abstract・§1 を読んだ。原著単行本は未取得。"}
